      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "A LIL BIT OF LOVE (9) finished third at Cowra two starts back then did a great job again at her latest appearance over 2100m at this track, beaten 5.5 metres into third after being handy in the run. No favours expected from this draw. Meets some better types this time but she has the ability to test this field. ALWAYSATTHEBEACH (8) produced a good effort at her latest run to get home by a narrow margin over 1710m at Goulburn on September 28. Won't spend a penny from this draw but luck may play a role on the bell lap. Facing a tougher assignment but she is good enough to cope. TULHURST PEBBLES (7) is the next elect off a last-start win by 2.25 metres at Young over 1720m. GET UP BETTY (4) is worth some thought after her last-start fourth over 1730m at Bathurst on September 30.",
